      "title": "No test covers the new snapshot write",
      "description": "onSave now writes the store to disk and returns a Promise. The repository has no test that exercises onSave or dispatch. No test caught the broken save path, and nothing will catch the next regression. Add a test that calls dispatch with the save action and checks the response text and the snapshot file.",
